Greed: This large stone worm, adorned with a wide variety of minerals, fiercely defends his cave and the treasure within it with all his might.
OreConstruct: Animated by Greed's otherworldy power, these constructs inherit the power of the ores their built from, aiding further in the defence of their king.
Scavenger: Worms who bring offerings to their King are rewarded with a portion of his power, evolving from lowly diggers to scavengers.
WormKingGreed: Now reawakened after the fall of the Moon Lord, this avaricious worm can finally reveal his long forgotten strength; bending the fabric of space with a power not of our dimension.
SingularityOfDesire: At his full strength, Greed is capable of conjuring these interdimensional portals. Whatever lies on the otherside wants you dead just as much as he does!
